<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>An automatic scooter rents by the month in Hanoi at verified prices from 900,000 to 2,000,000 VND, depending on the machine: 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND for the entry tier, confirmed at the counter as a range, and 1,500,000 to 2,000,000 VND for the step-up tier. This guide plans a monthly stay around those numbers, because a month is where the fleet's pricing rewards commitment the most.</p>
<p>We cover the verified monthly rates by model, the daily averages they buy, when the month beats the week, what each machine buys across thirty days, and the deposit, support and gear questions a month makes essential. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified monthly rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">What the month saves</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">A month in the entry tier</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">A month in the step-up tier</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Choosing between monthly machines</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">A month of automatic living in Hanoi</a></li>
